                                                "sense_id": "1bd8b9cf-6f54-3fe2-9e67-9af19882e005",
                                                "text": "I am glad that I chose the name Florence for my daughter, a real name with a history, rather than something that sounds as if it has been made up by a fifteen-year-old pop star's marketing team."
